OL,3,GNEWSACrews facing 'very challenging'
OL,4,Ablaze at scrap metal facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 firefighters worked
OL,7,Fthrough the night to bring a blaze at a
OL,8,Fscrap metal recycling facility under
OL,9,Fcontrol.
OL,11,FThe fire at Clearway Disposals in
OL,12,FBelfast's dock area was reported
OL,13,Fshortly after midday on Wednesday.
OL,15,FLarge plumes of black smoke surrounded
OL,16,Fthe area, forcing a cruise ship to
OL,17,Fleave early.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
