OL,3,GNEWSACrews facing 'very challenging'
OL,4,Ablaze at scrap metal facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,7,FService (NIFRS) said the cause of the
OL,8,Ffire was currently under investigation,
OL,9,Fbut suspected it may have been started
OL,10,Fby lithium-ion batteries.
